CREATE TABLE "HRVacancy" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"organizationId" TEXT NOT NULL,"schoolId" TEXT NOT NULL,"title" TEXT NOT NULL,"department" TEXT,"employmentType" TEXT,"description" TEXT,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'OPEN',"createdBy" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL); CREATE INDEX "HRVacancy_org_school_status_idx" ON "HRVacancy"("organizationId","schoolId","status");
CREATE TABLE "HRCandidate" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"organizationId" TEXT NOT NULL,"schoolId" TEXT NOT NULL,"vacancyId" TEXT,"name" TEXT NOT NULL,"email" TEXT,"phone" TEXT,"resumeUrl" TEXT,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'APPLIED',"notes" TEXT,"createdBy" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL); CREATE INDEX "HRCandidate_org_school_vacancy_status_idx" ON "HRCandidate"("organizationId","schoolId","vacancyId","status");
CREATE TABLE "HRInterview" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"organizationId" TEXT NOT NULL,"schoolId" TEXT NOT NULL,"candidateId" TEXT NOT NULL,"scheduledAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,"interviewerIds" JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT '[]',"feedback" TEXT,"outcome" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'SCHEDULED',"createdBy" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP); CREATE INDEX "HRInterview_org_school_candidate_schedule_idx" ON "HRInterview"("organizationId","schoolId","candidateId","scheduledAt");
CREATE TABLE "HRLeaveRequest" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"organizationId" TEXT NOT NULL,"schoolId" TEXT NOT NULL,"staffMemberId" TEXT NOT NULL,"leaveType" TEXT NOT NULL,"startDate" DATE NOT NULL,"endDate" DATE NOT NULL,"days" DECIMAL(5,2) NOT NULL,"reason" TEXT,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'PENDING',"reviewedBy" TEXT,"reviewedAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"reviewNote" TEXT,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL); CREATE INDEX "HRLeaveRequest_org_school_staff_status_idx" ON "HRLeaveRequest"("organizationId","schoolId","staffMemberId","status");
CREATE TABLE "HRPerformanceReview" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"organizationId" TEXT NOT NULL,"schoolId" TEXT NOT NULL,"staffMemberId" TEXT NOT NULL,"reviewPeriod" TEXT NOT NULL,"rating" INTEGER NOT NULL,"strengths" TEXT,"improvementAreas" TEXT,"goals" TEXT,"reviewerId" TEXT NOT NULL,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP); CREATE INDEX "HRPerformanceReview_org_school_staff_period_idx" ON "HRPerformanceReview"("organizationId","schoolId","staffMemberId","reviewPeriod");
CREATE TABLE "HRLifecycleChecklist" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"organizationId" TEXT NOT NULL,"schoolId" TEXT NOT NULL,"staffMemberId" TEXT NOT NULL,"stage" TEXT NOT NULL,"itemName" TEXT NOT NULL,"completed" BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,"completedAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"completedBy" TEXT,"notes" TEXT,"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"updatedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL); CREATE INDEX "HRLifecycleChecklist_org_school_staff_stage_idx" ON "HRLifecycleChecklist"("organizationId","schoolId","staffMemberId","stage");
